DO NOT RELAUNCH autoresearch_llm.py AS-IS.

On 2026-05-15, this script burned ~$46 in 536 wasted API calls due to:
- L1: Unconditional `continue` in invalid-proposal handler (lines 605-607)
- L2: 124-experiment history (~24k tokens) + max_tokens=1024 caused prose preambles, JSON parse failures
- L3: --max-api-cost tracks per-session counter, not Anthropic account balance

Required fixes before next run:
- Migrate to Anthropic tool_use schema (eliminates JSON parse risk structurally)
- Retry cap = 3 + exponential backoff (2s/4s/8s) + per-retry cost accounting
- History compression: top-20 by val_bpb + last-10 by recency
- Enable prompt-caching on SYSTEM_PROMPT + HYPERPARAMS block
- Hard cumulative cost ceiling: expected per-call cost × max-experiments, fail-closed
- Fail-closed on N consecutive parse failures (exit non-zero, not continue)

Strategic gate: probe-gate decision (Probes 1/3/4 cross-checkpoint) must also resolve
before next run, to confirm whether val_bpb is the right optimization target or whether
to switch to Probe 4 / MLM+contrastive arm.

To re-enable: remove this file, but ONLY after the above fixes are merged AND
probe-gate is resolved.
